return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-10T13:58:16+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-10T13:58:16+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'通过 Zinn® Campaigns 以您网店自有的名称，为您的网店发送短信和 WhatsApp 订单更新。一键连接；无需粘贴密钥。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'订单更新','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'您的商店已连接到 Zinn® Campaigns。','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'您的商店已断开连接。将不会发送任何消息。','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'该连接耗时过长或已在其他浏览器中启动。请再次点击“连接”。','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® 未接受连接。请再次点击“连接”；如果问题仍未解决，请联系 Zinn® 支持团队。','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'您的站点无法访问 Zinn®。请检查您的主机是否允许对外连接，然后再次点击“连接”。','Help'=>'帮助','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'以您店铺的名义，通过短信和 WhatsApp 向您的客户发送有关其订单的最新动态，费用从您的 Zinn® 额度中扣除。','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'“连接”将在当前窗口中打开 Zinn®。登录或创建账户，批准此商店，您便可直接返回此处。您无需粘贴任何密钥。','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'连接到 Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'已连接，但刚才无法联系到 Zinn®。我们稍后会再次尝试。','Store'=>'商店','Connected'=>'已连接','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'为您的账户开启','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'尚未对您的账户开放。开放后，Zinn® 将通过电子邮件通知您。','Disconnect'=>'断开连接','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'您无权连接此商店。','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'您无权断开此商店的连接。','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'通过短信将订单更新发送至我的电话号码。可能产生短信及流量费用。回复 STOP 即可停止。','Connection'=>'连接','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'您没有权限执行此操作。','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'谢谢。您现在可以请求协助并向 Zinn® 支持团队发送报告。','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'同意已撤回。在您再次同意之前，不会向 Zinn® 支持团队发送任何内容。','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'Zinn® AI 刚才无法回答。请将您的问题发送给下方团队；会有专人予以回复。','Glad that solved it.'=>'很高兴这解决了问题。','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'已发送。您的工单编号为 %s；团队将在此处以及通过电子邮件回复。','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'请填写主题、消息以及在您的商店未连接时的电子邮件地址。','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® 未接受该工单。请检查各字段并重试；如果仍然失败，请发送电子邮件至 support@zinndigital.com。','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'短时间内请求过多。请等待几分钟后再试。','Reply sent.'=>'回复已发送。','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'该工单已关闭。请提交新工单。','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'无法发送您的回复。请稍后再试。','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'等待 Zinn® 支持团队','Waiting on you'=>'等待您的操作','Answered'=>'已回复','Closed'=>'已关闭','Report a bug'=>'报告错误','Send feedback'=>'发送反馈','Request a feature'=>'请求功能','Ask for help'=>'寻求帮助','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'版本：WordPress、PHP、此插件、WooCommerce（以及是否使用 HPOS）和检测到的受支持插件','Your active theme and its version'=>'您当前使用的主题及其版本','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'已安装插件的列表、它们的版本以及各自是否处于启用状态','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'连接：您的商店地址、是否已连接、此安装的 ID 以及 Zinn® 是否响应了其最新检查（绝不会包含商店的令牌）','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Zinn® 订单更新：帮助','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'撤回我发送帮助请求的同意','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'此处的帮助由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 提供解答。在任何内容离开您的站点之前，以下是具体发送的内容及其去向：','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'您输入的问题：将发送至 api.zinndigital.com 的 Zinn® AI，由其根据 Zinn® 帮助文章进行解答。','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'您发送的工单：其主题、您的消息、您的管理语言和回复电子邮件地址，已发送至 Zinn® 支持团队。','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'诊断：仅包含您勾选的区块，发送前均会完整显示。绝不包含商店的令牌、密码或您客户的详细信息。','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'您的工单：在您的商店连接期间，此屏幕会从 Zinn® 读取您的工单和团队的回复。','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'我们记录了谁在何时表示同意。您可以随时在此屏幕上撤回同意。','Agree and continue'=>'同意并继续','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'询问 Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'您在哪些方面需要帮助？','Ask'=>'提问','Help articles'=>'帮助文章','That solved it'=>'已解决问题','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'仍需帮助？请发送给下方团队。','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'将其发送给 Zinn® 团队','What is it?'=>'这是什么？','Subject'=>'主题','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'发生了什么？对于错误，请提供重现该问题的步骤。','Reply e-mail'=>'回复电子邮件','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'留空以使用